  "stem": "A breathless patient with a known COPD history has an ABG: pH 7.26, PaCO₂ 9.0 kPa, PaO₂ 7.5 kPa on controlled oxygen, HCO₃⁻ 30 mmol/L. He is drowsy. Besides controlled oxygen, what is the most appropriate next step?",
