  "why_wrong": "A. Oral mesalazine is inadequate for acute severe disease. B. Antimotility agents risk toxic megacolon. C. Colectomy is reserved for failure of medical therapy or complications, not the first step. D. Antibiotics alone do not treat the underlying inflammation.",
