  "why_wrong": "A. Immunoglobulin and full re-vaccination are for non-responders or the unvaccinated, not a documented responder. B. After a confirmed HBsAg-positive exposure a booster is given rather than doing nothing. C. Lifelong tenofovir treats chronic hepatitis B infection, not post-exposure prophylaxis. E. Repeated immunoglobulin is not the management for a documented responder.",
