  "why_wrong": "B. Colposcopy follows abnormal cytology in HPV-positive samples, not a negative HPV result. C. Early repeat is for specific HPV-positive/cytology-negative pathways. D. LLETZ treats confirmed high-grade CIN. E. Cytology is only examined if HPV is positive.",
