  "why_wrong": "B. Continuing lithium worsens toxicity. C. More lithium is dangerous. D. Potassium does not treat lithium toxicity. E. These are toxic, not expected, effects.",
  "pearl": "Lithium toxicity → stop lithium + IV fluids + dialysis if severe; check precipitants.",
  "thinking": "Coarse tremor + ataxia + confusion + high level ↓ lithium toxicity ↓ stop + fluids + dialysis if severe",
  "exam_trap": "Dismissing lithium toxicity as side effects — it needs the drug stopped, fluids, and dialysis if severe.",
  "takeaway": "Lithium toxicity is managed by stopping lithium, IV fluids and dialysis if severe.",
