  "why_wrong": "A. Antipsychotics are not first-line for withdrawal. B. Untreated withdrawal can be fatal (seizures, DTs). C. A beta-blocker alone does not prevent seizures or DTs. E. Indefinite alcohol does not treat dependence and harms.",
